                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.1115/3956: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Seville</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-13">August 13, 1937</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Kane</hi> leaving St. Jean de Luz, France,
                    Sunday morning for Santander and Gijon to evacuate American nationals. Please
                    inform appropriate insurgent authorities.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
